<catalogue id="f703-f9e6-306c-6e27" name="Halo - Flood" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="6f3b-423b-f7e2-caee" gameSystemRevision="1" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema"><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="c7b1-e73d-173a-ebe0" name="Army Setup" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="f652-bf22-76fc-e157"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="1319-bb64-f8a7-2669"/></constraints><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="7d4b-b75e-4524-a6c9" name="Army Setup" hidden="false" targetId="a02c-b714-98ad-b8e8" primary="true"/></categoryLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="4b9b-20b5-8401-066f" name="Army: Flood" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="35dd-e18f-7123-14e9"/></constraints><rules><rule id="ef01-407c-f756-5a11" name="Living Nightmare" hidden="false"><description>All Flood Infantry and Artillery units have the Fanatics special rule, and automatically pass any Morale Check. Remember Morale checks are not Order tests.

Reminder:
Fanatics: Ignore pin modifiers on Morale checks and are not routed by pins. If defeated in close quarters, fight again immediately until they win or are wiped out.</description></rule><rule id="a62e-28ab-cdbb-8e60" name="Hivemind Coordination" hidden="false"><description>Flood Infantry and Artillery units do not suffer the -1 morale penalty for losing their NCO.</description></rule><rule id="29b2-b644-294b-9cfc" name="Predatory Ambush" hidden="false"><description>When a Flood Infantry unit ends the turn on Ambush and chooses to attempt the normal end-of-turn Fire action, roll a D6 as usual. On a 4+, the unit may either fire normally or, instead of firing, declare an Assault against a visible enemy Infantry or Artillery unit within assault range. On a 3 or less, the unit does nothing and its Ambush die is returned to the bag as normal.</description></rule><rule id="0478-eb05-a2a1-7b84" name="Logic Plague" hidden="false"><description>Once per turn, just before activating a Flood unit, select one unactivated enemy Automaton or Composed Being within 6&quot; of any friendly Flood unit and roll a D6:

  * 1-3: The enemy immediately receives 2 Pin markers.
  * 4-5: The enemy suffers -1 to hit for the rest of the turn.
  * 6: The enemy must take a Morale check. If failed, roll on the FUBAR table; if passed, no effect.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="8d78-d875-806f-dc6a" name="Officer - Key Mind Node (Platoon commander)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit"><profiles><profile id="c463-257e-a94b-4004" name="Officer - Key Mind Node (Platoon commander)" hidden="false" typeId="4f99-c622-96b9-db14" typeName="Unit"><modifiers><modifier type="increment" field="c162-476c-a031-003b" value="1"><repeats><repeat value="1" repeats="1" field="selections" scope="8d78-d875-806f-dc6a" childId="6737-fde0-9ea4-06e7" shared="true" roundUp="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></repeats></modifier><modifier type="decrement" field="c162-476c-a031-003b" value="1"/><modifier type="set" field="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29" value="3+"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="8d78-d875-806f-dc6a" childId="2702-6756-1e24-37a1" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier><modifier type="set" field="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29" value="5+"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="8d78-d875-806f-dc6a" childId="6c22-a25a-a443-88a4" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><characteristics><characteristic name="Type" typeId="edb9-a03d-e44e-2632">Infantry</characteristic><characteristic name="Models" typeId="c162-476c-a031-003b">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Damage Value" typeId="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Transport" typeId="5d1c-b220-d676-62fa">–</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="8255-f2cc-337e-3c3c" name="Unarmed" hidden="false" typeId="687b-50c6-e68d-9ed8" typeName="Weapon"><modifiers><modifier type="increment" field="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2" value="1"><repeats><repeat value="1" repeats="1" field="selections" scope="8d78-d875-806f-dc6a" childId="6737-fde0-9ea4-06e7" shared="true" roundUp="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></repeats></modifier><modifier type="decrement" field="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2" value="1"/></modifiers><characteristics><characteristic name="Qty" typeId="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="88e2-96b8-e9cf-cb86">–</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="164a-51d2-e474-ab4c">–</characteristic><characteristic name="Pen" typeId="d266-c548-f63b-0ea2">–</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="0bf8-e72d-45f4-c21d">No ranged weapon</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="e3ca-8462-27bb-ec39" name="Tendrils" hidden="false"><description>Models that replace 'men' in the unit. They are considered to have the Melee Weapons special rules.</description></rule><rule id="d95c-e263-44b3-1c2f" name="Immobile" hidden="false"><description>If no tendrils are present, the unit cannot move.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="b18b-67b5-e121-3fb9" name="Platoon Commander" hidden="false" targetId="d64b-7cdb-29ec-6b71" type="rule"/><infoLink id="4b9e-f861-948c-68b2" name="Flood Infection" hidden="false" targetId="24cd-a6a9-7341-a58c" type="rule"/><infoLink id="bdcb-f1c1-47f7-3a85" name="Horror" hidden="false" targetId="8d17-f961-100c-1c5d" type="rule"/><infoLink id="08b5-e195-0461-1af9" name="Slow" hidden="false" targetId="bd3f-7e85-734f-43d8" type="rule"/><infoLink id="1002-0d58-6a28-43b4" name="Wide Formation" hidden="false" targetId="ddd5-7152-2e25-0414" type="rule"/><infoLink id="e3c4-69fb-3ed5-6499" name="Tough Fighters" hidden="false" targetId="5615-e6c8-37bd-dd58" type="rule"/><infoLink id="a6b6-e762-0aa8-4aac" name="Strong" hidden="false" targetId="3126-cc8a-a2dd-7dbe" type="rule"/><infoLink id="819b-9681-244c-5aaf" name="Hardened" hidden="false" targetId="ffcf-0cd9-ce23-56c5" type